-- words --
A new rule with no variant: the candidate adds the rule NewRule to the kept model in goals/model/, and no variant config of the Goal names it; hyp status G lists the candidate as held back by the Spec guard, rule-no-variant, naming NewRule.
-- run --
hyp status G-ONE --role runner
-- floor: contains --
rule-no-variant
-- floor: contains --
NewRule
-- ceiling --
hyp select G-ONE
